WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.040
Hi, it's Dr. Kim. Your procedure is one week away, so it's a great time to get a few things

2
00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:10.040
in order. First, pick up your bowel prep kit from the pharmacy if you haven't already.

3
00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:13.600
Secondly, make sure you have a responsible adult lined up to drive you home — you won't

4
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:18.320
be able to drive yourself after the procedure. Also, stock your fridge with clear liquids:

5
00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:23.400
water, broth, clear juices, and popsicles. Starting now, begin shifting to a low-fiber

6
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:28.840
diet. Cut back on raw vegetables, whole grains, nuts, and seeds. And lastly, take a moment

7
00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:33.200
to review your current medications. If you take blood thinners, iron supplements, or

8
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:38.840
diabetes medications, we have specific guidance for each of those in the next few videos. As

9
00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:42.760
always, if anything comes up, don't hesitate to reach out to your doctor's office. You're

10
00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:43.800
off to a great start.
